
// ============================================================
// ⚡ SESSION KICKOFF — read this first (AI helper or human)
//
// WHAT THIS GENERATOR IS
//   A perchance PLUGIN ("zelda-audio") that streams Zelda soundtracks.
//   DONE: Ocarina of Time (86) + A Link to the Past (31) + The Wind Waker
//     (133) + Breath of the Wild (211) game OSTs, plus the full ZREO
//     orchestral library (21 albums, 331 tracks, orchestralTracks — direct
//     static.zreoarchive.org URLs; 12 of 18 link-to-the-past album tracks
//     mirrored on user.uploads.dev).
//   Importable from other generators as:
//     zeldaAudio = \{import:zelda-audio\}
//     (save THIS generator as "zelda-audio" for that import to work)
//   API: play / playShuffle / startPlaylist / find / pick / next / prev /
//     stop / pause / resume / seek / setVolume / volume / loop / crossfade /
//     current / isPlaying / audioEl / onTrackChange / onEnd / playUrl
//     plus cats / games / eras / albums metadata.
//   Demo player UI lives in index.html.
//
// STATUS: 792 tracks total. Game OSTs: OoT + LttP hosted on user.uploads.dev
//   (permanent URLs); WW + BotW streamed directly from archive.org (verified
//   playable via <audio>; no re-host needed). Orchestral tracks stream
//   directly from static.zreoarchive.org (verified playable via <audio>).
// PENDING SOURCES — none currently. See the TODO list for future ideas.
//
// PERCHANCE/PJS GOTCHAS (learned the hard way — respect these)
//   - NO multi-line or nested square-bracket blocks. A `name = [ ... ]`
//     assignment must be ONE line and its JS must not contain nested [ ].
//   - List items that are square-bracket object literals get stringified to
//     "[object Object]". Store data as list properties instead (the
//     `name = value` lines in ootTracks) and read them in JS via
//     node.<prop>.evaluateItem.
//   - `name = [code]` RE-EVALUATES the code on every access of root.name —
//     so keep mutable state somewhere persistent. This plugin caches its API
//     object on window.__zeldaAudioApi and all playback state on
//     window.__zeldaAudioState (see getState()).
//   - pjs functions use `name(args) =>` with an indented body; all normal
//     JS (loops, braces, closures) is fine inside.
// ============================================================

$meta
  title = Zelda Audio — OSTs & ZREO Orchestra
  description = The Legend of Zelda soundtrack plugin: 792 tracks — Ocarina of Time (86), A Link to the Past (31), The Wind Waker (133), Breath of the Wild (211) and the full ZREO orchestral library (21 albums, 331 tracks). Stream, shuffle, search, crossfade; import it in any generator with a single line and use root.zeldaAudio.
  tags = zelda, ocarina of time, a link to the past, soundtrack, orchestral, zreo, music, audio, plugin
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/172dddb69b8f8ef80ce932b7a9ec8066.jpg

// ============================================================
// TODO LIST — work through these one at a time, top to bottom.
// Mark each done (or note why it's parked) as it's completed.
// ============================================================
// [x] 1. COMPLETE THE LttP OST — DONE (2026-08-20): rebuilt lttpTracks as the
//        complete 31-track SNES OST (archive.org item
//        "the-legend-of-zelda-a-link-to-the-past-ost"), re-hosted all 31 mp3s
//        on user.uploads.dev, with real durations + category mapping. The old
//        12-track lttpTracks turned out to be ZREO orchestral arrangements
//        (12/18 of the link-to-the-past album) — those were moved into
//        orchestralTracks with their uploads.dev URLs as mirrors (byte-
//        identity verified), which also advanced the re-host TODO by 12.
// [x] 2. COMPUTE TRACK DURATIONS — DONE (2026-08-20): all 331 orchestral
//        tracks now carry `length = mm:ss` (computed from browser audio
//        metadata — the mp3s have Xing headers, so durations are exact).
//        Every track across all games now shows a duration in the UI/API.
// [x] 3. PLAYLIST-AWARE PLAY — DONE (2026-08-20): clicking a track seeds the
//        currently filtered list (game/era/album/cat/search) as the playlist
//        starting at that track, so next/prev flow through what you're
//        looking at. Selecting an album also shows a "▶ Play this album"
//        button in the album chip row.
// [x] 4. PERSIST VOLUME + LOOP — DONE (2026-08-20): saved to localStorage
//        ("zeldaAudioSettings") by the plugin API itself (setVolume/loop also
//        persist, so imported generators get it for free). Chose localStorage
//        over kv-plugin for two tiny settings — no extra import needed.
//        Demo UI initializes slider + loop button from the saved values.
// [x] 5. $meta.image — DONE (2026-08-20): set to the generated Triforce banner
//        (https://user.uploads.dev/file/172dddb69b8f8ef80ce932b7a9ec8066.jpg);
//        title/description/tags also refreshed to cover the full library.
// [x] 6. FAVORITES + SHARE DEEP LINKS — DONE (2026-08-20): ♥ per-track
//        favorites (plugin API: favorites()/isFavorite()/toggleFavorite(),
//        localStorage-backed like #4) with a "♥ Favorites" chip in the demo
//        UI. Deep links: ?track=<query> on the generator URL auto-seeds a
//        playlist of matching tracks and queues the first (autoplay still
//        needs a user gesture per browser policy — the queued track shows in
//        the now-playing bar and starts on play).
// [x] 7. MINOR POLISH — DONE (2026-08-20): search/find match era names
//        (console/handheld/compositions); default crossfade ~800ms for
//        orchestral tracks (overridable via crossfade()); ←/→ arrow keys for
//        prev/next; decorative gold equalizer canvas in the now-playing bar
//        (decorative, not Web-Audio routed — routing would hijack the
//        plugin's volume/crossfade path).
// [x] 8. WIND WAKER OST — DONE (2026-08-20): all 133 tracks added as
//        wwTracks (2 discs, category-mapped, real durations). Streamed
//        DIRECTLY from archive.org (item "the-legend-of-zelda-takt-of-wind-
//        original-sound-tracks") — verified <audio> playable, so no re-host
//        was needed (saved ~199MB of uploads). Track objects carry disc 1|2.
// [x] 9. BREATH OF THE WILD OST — DONE (2026-08-20): all 211 tracks added
//        as botwTracks (5 discs incl. bonus, category-mapped, real
//        durations). Streamed DIRECTLY from archive.org (item "the-legend-of-
//        zelda-breath-of-the-wild-original-soundtrack") — verified <audio>
//        playable, so no re-host needed (saved ~1.2GB of uploads).
//        Track objects carry disc 1-5.
// ============================================================
// ALL ORIGINAL TODO ITEMS ARE NOW COMPLETE. Possible future work:
//   - Oracle of Ages/Seasons, Link's Awakening, other OSTs (same process)
//   - ZREO re-host migration (see the note above orchestralTracks — 319 left)
//   - Per-album cover art for the orchestral albums
// ============================================================
// NOTE: item 1 also reduces the plugin's dependence on the 12 user.uploads.dev
// LttP files, but the big dependency to remember is ZREO (see the TODO note
// above orchestralTracks) — don't add features that deepen it.
// ============================================================

// ============================================================
// zeldaAudio — The Legend of Zelda audio plugin
// Games included: ocarina of time ("oot"), a link to the past ("lttp")
// Audio hosted on user.uploads.dev (permanent URLs, re-hosted from
//   https://archive.org/details/tloz-oot-original-soundtrack)
// Track list generated from IA metadata (86 tracks).
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// IMPORT in another generator (main.pjs):
//   zeldaAudio = \{import:zelda-audio\}
// (save THIS generator as "zelda-audio" so that import works)
// Then use it via root.zeldaAudio:
//
//   root.zeldaAudio.play("boss")              -> random boss battle
//   root.zeldaAudio.play("song of time")      -> search by name substring
//   root.zeldaAudio.playShuffle("overworld")  -> endless shuffle of a category
//   root.zeldaAudio.playShuffle("")           -> shuffle every track
//   root.zeldaAudio.setVolume(0.5)
//   root.zeldaAudio.loop(true)
//   root.zeldaAudio.crossfade(1200)           -> 1.2s crossfade on changes
//   root.zeldaAudio.stop()
//
// Categories: title overworld town dungeon boss combat ocarina
//   event ambient minigame jingle credits
// Full API: find / pick / play / playUrl / playShuffle /
//   startPlaylist / next / prev / stop / pause / resume / seek /
//   setVolume / volume / loop / crossfade / current / isPlaying /
//   audioEl / onTrackChange / onEnd
//
// PENDING sources for future games are tracked in the
// pendingAudioSources and orchestralAudioSources lists below.
// ============================================================

