// ---------- Orchestral (ZREO): 21 albums · 331 tracks ----------
// Fan-made orchestral arrangements from zreoarchive.org. NOT original game
// OSTs — they live in their own "orchestral" category + game "orchestral",
// browsable/shuffleable separately from oot/lttp. URLs point directly at
// static.zreoarchive.org: verified playable in the perchance runtime via
// audio (the old "must re-host" note was about fetch() CORS, which audio
// tags don't need). Catalogue built from the full URL list (2026-08).
// TODO (future): migrate these 331 track URLs away from static.zreoarchive.
// org to user.uploads.dev or another suitable hosting provider — the ZREO
// domain is a third-party fan site we don't control, so it could go offline
// or change its CDN at any time. When migrating: re-host each mp3, then
// replace the `url` line on each item (a script can rewrite them in bulk).
// Until then the plugin depends on zreo staying up.
// PROGRESS: 12 of the 18 link-to-the-past album tracks already use
// user.uploads.dev mirror URLs (byte-identical copies, verified) — 319 to go.
